This module in charge of constructing the graph structure on each rank, and build the Hamiltonian and Overlap from file or direct node/edge feature like input from atomicdata in python.

The supported data type include:
h5 file
atomicdata like node/edge feature
R -> CSR format
others ...

This should be a intermidiate format that can be used to building the interface between other DFT software and the solver in rsatb.

